<title>PERU: SOCCER-PERU BEAT VENEZUELA 4-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-PERU BEAT VENEZUELA 4-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1996-11-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peru beat Venezuela 4-1 (halftime 2-0) in a World Cup South American qualifer on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Peru - Juan Reynoso (5), Julinho (22), Roberto Palacios (49, 82).</p>
<p>Venezuela - Luis Vera (77).</p>
<p>Attendance: 31,000.</p>
